# Local `wrangler dev` reads secrets/vars from a .dev.vars file (gitignored)
# instead of wrangler.toml. Copy this to .dev.vars and fill in what you need
# — everything is optional; panels fall back to sample data until their
# integration is configured. See README for the deployed-Worker equivalent
# (`wrangler secret put`).

# Google OAuth client (Web application) from console.cloud.google.com.
# Authorized redirect URI for local dev: http://localhost:8787/api/auth/google/callback
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=

# Master-password login — leave unset for local dev.
# DASHBOARD_PASSWORD=
# SESSION_SECRET=

# iCloud calendars: public webcal:// share links, comma-separated.
# ICLOUD_ICS_URLS=
